            "caption": "Fig. 5.2",
            "src": "figures/q5_fig5_2.png",
            "alt": "Pain-pathway synapses with endorphin receptors, acetylcholine vesicles and receptors, and the impulse stimulated by a TENS machine.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 14
            }
          }
        ],
